OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers possible at first
OL,6,Fthis morning, but these will quickly
OL,7,Fclear leaving another dry day today
OL,8,Fwith plenty of sunshine. Feeling
OL,9,Fnoticeably cooler than of late though,
OL,10,Fas a strengthening westerly breeze
OL,11,Fdevelops throughout the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry with plenty of
OL,14,Fclear skies across the region tonight.
OL,15,FTemperatures a little lower than of
OL,16,Flate, leading to a more comfortable
OL,17,Fnight for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
