OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,6,Fspells of sunshine, although the
OL,7,Fsunshine maybe rather hazy at times.
OL,8,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,9,FAugust but again much cooler than of
OL,10,Flate.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Fdry and bright on Friday and Saturday
OL,14,Fwith temperatures also trending
OL,15,Fupwards again. A very small risk of
OL,16,Fsome showers on Sunday but staying dry
OL,17,Fand warm for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
